1
00:00:02,569 --> 00:00:03,569
Yijun?

2
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:04,804
Huh?

3
00:00:04,804 --> 00:00:06,906
Did you fix
Hye-won's schedule

4
00:00:08,141 --> 00:00:09,609
because of me?

5
00:00:10,443 --> 00:00:11,411
Was it that obvious?

6
00:00:11,411 --> 00:00:12,412
A little bit?

7
00:00:12,412 --> 00:00:13,880
That's partially true.

8
00:00:14,199 --> 00:00:16,434
But I didn't want to waste
Hye-won's potential.

9
00:00:16,683 --> 00:00:18,251
I think she's amazing.

10
00:00:18,251 --> 00:00:21,254
She has a goal
and she works hard for it.

11
00:00:21,488 --> 00:00:24,491
I don't even know what
I'm going to do next year.

12
00:00:26,426 --> 00:00:29,496
You know, pretty flowers
tend to have less scent.

13
00:00:30,463 --> 00:00:32,332
The real fragrant ones

14
00:00:33,767 --> 00:00:35,368
are the small flowers
like these.

15
00:00:37,237 --> 00:00:38,772
I think you're like them.

16
00:00:39,305 --> 00:00:42,942
It might seem rough now
with no one recognizing you

17
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:44,677
But someday

18
00:00:44,677 --> 00:00:47,180
people are going to
notice you.

19
00:00:48,214 --> 00:00:50,183
I mean, look at me.

20
00:00:50,183 --> 00:00:53,219
I failed my first business
but I still fix flowers.

21
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:56,222
With good people at my side.

22
00:00:57,057 --> 00:00:59,192
Am I too patronizing?

23
00:00:59,192 --> 00:01:00,192
No.

24
00:01:00,326 --> 00:01:01,428
Thank you, Yijun.

25
00:01:02,629 --> 00:01:04,998
- Can I ask you something?
- What?

26
00:01:05,432 --> 00:01:06,466
Does Hye-won know?

27
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:08,868
She helped me a lot.

28
00:01:09,436 --> 00:01:10,236
Then...

29
00:01:10,236 --> 00:01:11,916
What kind of relationship
do you guys have?

30
00:01:12,405 --> 00:01:14,707
- Nothing particular.
- Oh, really?

31
00:01:14,707 --> 00:01:15,775
Thank goodness.

32
00:01:16,709 --> 00:01:17,710
- What?
- Huh?

33
00:01:17,710 --> 00:01:18,912
- What?
- What?

34
00:01:18,912 --> 00:01:20,447
- You just said...
- What did I say?

35
00:01:21,548 --> 00:01:23,883
Can you help me
with the loads?

36
00:01:25,251 --> 00:01:25,985
I'll go.

37
00:01:25,985 --> 00:01:27,053
Oh, right, go.
